 If you want more flexibility to customize your Fizzy installation by changing its code, and deploy those changes to your server, then we recommend you deploy Fizzy with Kamal. You can find a complete walkthrough of doing that in our [Kamal deployment guide](docs/kamal-deployment.md).
 
+### Moving an account between Fizzy instances
+
+Admins can export a whole account, as a single .zip file, from the account settings. To bring it into another Fizzy, sign in there and go to `/account/imports/new`: you'll get a new account with everything in it, and everyone in the account will be able to sign in with their email address. Instances that only allow a single account accept imports while they don't have any accounts yet, right after you sign up.
